    "title": "1.5 ton inverter AC, eight hours a day",
    "text": "Up to 1,450 W running and 1,900 W at full speed, 7.9 A. Counted at its average draw it uses 8 units a day and 240 units a month, about Rs 8,750, the biggest single appliance in most homes."
